          "explanation": "This visit occurs 8 days post-cholecystectomy, well within the AHCIP global surgical window for the operating surgeon. If the rendering provider is the same surgeon (or their group) who performed the cholecystectomy, post-operative follow-up care is included in the surgical package and is not separately billable to AHCIP. If a different provider (e.g., the patient's family physician) is performing this follow-up, it is billable, but that must be clearly documented and a -24 or analogous unlinking mechanism may be required. The note does not identify the provider's relationship to the original surgery, and no modifier has been appended to indicate a provider outside the global package."
